cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Mpichi Dataset: An Open Bilingual Resource of Congolese (DRC) Recipes"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Simba Wa Nkulu"
    given-names: Jack
    email: jacksimba28@gmail.com
    alias: Likeur
    website: https://likeur.xyz
repository-code: https://github.com/Likeur/mpichi-dataset
url: https://mpichi.likeur.xyz
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: 1.5.0
date-released: "2026-10-25"
abstract: >-
  Open bilingual (French / English) dataset of Congolese (DRC) recipes from
  Mpichi, with multilingual aliases, normalized regions, structured ingredients,
  instruction pairs, an eval Q/A split, and a documented TF-IDF retrieval
  baseline. Text under CC BY 4.0; scripts under MIT. Contact: jacksimba28@gmail.com.
keywords:
  - Congo
  - DRC
  - recipes
  - cuisine
  - French
  - English
  - Lingala
  - Swahili
  - LLM
  - fine-tuning
  - RAG
  - open data
